WEBVTT

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.625
MISSION 9: REDTOOTH

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.333
1,20 YUAN PER CATTY

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.708
A catty of Chinese cabbage, please.

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:30.958
That will be 1,20 yuan.

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.958
CHICKEN ISLAND NOTICE BOARD

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:41.791
UNDERWEAR DESIGNER SHOW, LI JIAN

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.708
SHARE FUN NEWS
VICIOUS MURDERER ON THE LAM

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:45.833
MEN, WOMEN

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:02.125
GOD'S HANDS SPA

00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:04.208
MASSAGE AND CUPPING

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:37.833
Come out.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.041
Long time no see, senior.

00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:51.291
You secretly learned
the Way of the Blood Demon.

00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:53.791
You're no longer a disciple
of the Heaven Lily Clan.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.833
So you have no right to call me senior.

00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:01.041
Weren't you also expelled
for having a love affair?

00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:02.916
Quan, you slandered me.

00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:10.125
My name is Quan no more.

00:02:10.625 --> 00:02:12.416
It's now Redtooth.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.000
REDTOOTH
ONE OF THE SEVEN SHADOW KILLERS

00:02:51.791 --> 00:02:53.791
GOD'S HANDS SPA

00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:55.875
MASSAGE AND CUPPING

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.250
-There's a fight, run!
-Run!

00:02:58.333 --> 00:02:59.500
Hurry!

00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:08.208
Didn't think he had grown so strong.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:17.250
It has been ten years,
and you've rusted so much, senior.

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:20.833
FORCE OF YOUNG LADY,
WHITE LILY PURITY BLAST

00:03:35.375 --> 00:03:37.250
How much blood have you consumed

00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:40.125
to attain such a level of combat power?

00:03:45.916 --> 00:03:49.458
Your White Lily Purity Blast
is so pure yet so powerful.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.500
No wonder Master liked you so much.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:23.125
SEVEN

00:04:28.916 --> 00:04:30.041
What are you staring at?

00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:31.875
Goods sold are not refundable.

00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:35.583
Run for your lives.

00:04:38.958 --> 00:04:41.000
Stop right there. Hands in the air!

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.083
<i>Those red teeth can bite
any sort of weapon.</i>

00:04:58.666 --> 00:05:02.458
<i>Don't tell me that he's one of
the Seven Shadow Killers.</i>

00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:04.083
<i>Redtooth?</i>

00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:09.000
This one's pretty dangerous.

00:05:09.166 --> 00:05:10.583
You have to stay home from now on.

00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:29.416
Hey, did you mess with
my beef offal stall?

00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:31.708
Are his gums bleeding?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.083
Senior.

00:05:34.458 --> 00:05:38.875
Do you know that you're the most
highly-prized on the hit list?

00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:42.750
But I'm not here to kill you.

00:05:43.416 --> 00:05:44.666
I just want you

00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:50.166
to unlock this White Lily Seal.

00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:54.958
Why do you still not get it?

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.583
I sealed the Blood Demon
in your body for your own good.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.083
I despise it the most when you speak
in the same tone as our master.

00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:16.583
The Indestructible Virgin.

00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:19.666
THE INDESTRUCTIBLE VIRGIN

00:06:20.208 --> 00:06:21.791
Can't you see how unhygienic that was?

00:06:21.875 --> 00:06:23.541
Go to hell!

00:06:30.625 --> 00:06:33.166
<i>Indestructible Double-Edged Sword.</i>

00:06:33.333 --> 00:06:34.208
RED CLAWS

00:06:34.291 --> 00:06:35.250
DACHUN-SHIELD

00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:36.500
BATTLE

00:06:38.833 --> 00:06:39.666
DACHUN-SWORD

00:06:42.791 --> 00:06:44.208
Is this even possible?

00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:46.791
BACK-ATTACK

00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:48.208
DACHUN-PROTECTION SHIELD

00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:49.208
QI CONTROLLED SCISSORS

00:06:55.541 --> 00:06:57.375
Credit card or cash?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.833
After the match, please.

00:06:59.083 --> 00:07:01.250
Everyone plays a part
in defending our island.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.750
What level of indestructibility are you?

00:07:06.875 --> 00:07:08.333
That's our secret--

00:07:08.416 --> 00:07:09.333
Level Seven.

00:07:14.125 --> 00:07:15.500
It looks like he has read us.

00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:17.458
Why do you ask so much?

00:07:17.541 --> 00:07:19.666
Eat my Spring Double-Edged Sword!

00:07:20.166 --> 00:07:23.333
When you haven't fully mastered
your indestructibility,

00:07:23.416 --> 00:07:25.541
you'll always have this one fatal flaw.

00:07:35.791 --> 00:07:37.041
Oh no!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.125
You don't suppose these little tricks
of yours can defeat me, do you?

00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:57.125
SEVEN

00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:19.500
He sucked Buzz Cut's blood
and he's about to turn into a hemophile.

00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:22.458
Once he reaches that stage,
no one can stop him.

00:08:23.041 --> 00:08:26.375
Looks like I'll have to use the Heaven
Lily Clan's ultimate tour-de-force,

00:08:26.458 --> 00:08:28.666
the Blossoming of the White Lily
in order to defeat him.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.500
What are you waiting for? Unleash it now.

00:08:32.208 --> 00:08:36.458
But I need your assistance
to activate this technique.

00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:39.708
Don't be so coy.
It's not like we're going to kiss.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.666
Do we really have to...

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:45.708
Yes.

00:08:46.041 --> 00:08:47.958
The Heaven Lily Clan banned romance

00:08:48.041 --> 00:08:50.583
in order for us to perfect
this exceptional skill.

00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:52.458
Kissing someone of the opposite sex can

00:08:52.541 --> 00:08:54.666
-activate my bodily--
-It doesn't have to be me, right?

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.916
-DaChun can do it.
-But I...

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.791
Ichiro can do it.

00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:01.000
I already have a girlfriend.

00:09:01.083 --> 00:09:02.500
And she won't approve of this.

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:04.250
Dai Bo can do it.

00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:06.125
But I'm just a chicken.

00:09:06.666 --> 00:09:08.208
I can do it!

00:09:08.958 --> 00:09:10.208
Kiss me--

00:09:10.833 --> 00:09:12.208
He's too weak.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.875
Chairman Jiang, I'm seriously suspecting
that you're captivated by my...

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.000
That looks horrifying.

00:09:40.291 --> 00:09:43.916
-You were indeed captivated by me.
-Maybe we didn't kiss long enough.

00:09:44.541 --> 00:09:45.958
Want to try again?

00:09:46.541 --> 00:09:47.916
I think I've had enough.

00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:53.291
What was the order that I gave you?

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.583
"Kill him, and bring back his sword."

00:09:58.041 --> 00:09:59.583
Then why is he still alive?

00:10:02.958 --> 00:10:04.958
Because he saved me.

00:10:05.625 --> 00:10:06.916
So I owed him one.

00:10:09.166 --> 00:10:10.625
Let me repay it for you

00:10:11.041 --> 00:10:13.375
and then kill him.

00:11:06.416 --> 00:11:08.250
Chairman Jiang beautified herself.

00:11:15.916 --> 00:11:18.000
Don't get so excited
when you're seriously injured.

00:11:19.875 --> 00:11:24.500
Could this be the legendary
secret technique of the Heaven Lily Clan,

00:11:24.916 --> 00:11:26.500
the Blossoming of the White Lily?

00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:38.958
Starting today,

00:11:39.541 --> 00:11:42.250
you are disciples of the Heaven Lily Clan.

00:12:15.375 --> 00:12:18.125
SENIOR, I LOVE YOU.

00:12:21.458 --> 00:12:24.125
ROMANTIC RELATIONSHIPS
ARE NOT ALLOWED IN HEAVEN LILY.

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:36.625
LET'S LEAVE HERE.

00:12:40.166 --> 00:12:42.208
SORRY, I CAN'T.

00:12:43.958 --> 00:12:45.041
From now on,

00:12:45.375 --> 00:12:48.833
Huilian is the heir
to the Heaven Lily Clan.

00:12:53.458 --> 00:12:55.541
FORBIDDEN AREA

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:08.875
HEAVEN LILY

00:13:08.958 --> 00:13:12.416
PURE AS WHITE LILY
PEACE IN THE HEART

00:13:40.166 --> 00:13:41.666
<i>If you rescue him,</i>

00:13:42.333 --> 00:13:46.416
<i>you will have turned against your mentor,
for which I'll expel you both.</i>

00:13:49.333 --> 00:13:50.625
<i>I'm sorry, Master.</i>

00:13:51.208 --> 00:13:52.875
<i>I broke the rules of the clan.</i>

00:13:54.708 --> 00:13:55.916
<i>I love him.</i>
